Recommends: dbus-bin
Description: Pebble watch notifications for Maemo Leste
 Ripple forwards incoming messages and Modest IMAP email notifications to
 a paired Pebble watch over Bluetooth Classic RFCOMM. It supports configurable
 notification filters and watch music controls through OSCP or MAFW.
 .
 The wtrd daemon runs as the desktop user. The wtr command provides manual
 controls and opt-in startup at graphical login.
